{
  "name": "n8n Connect · Enviar al móvil",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3d604c72-6c34-41cd-aa5f-47a4d3bc272f",
      "name": "Al llamar desde otro workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "email"
            },
            {
              "name": "title"
            },
            {
              "name": "body"
            },
            {
              "name": "actions",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "name": "app"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "59bd81c1-1899-4a67-9f40-13dde39adedc",
      "name": "Dispositivos con push",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_DATA_TABLE_ID:nc_devices",
          "cachedResultName": "nc_devices"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "email",
              "keyValue": "={{ String($json.email || \"\").toLowerCase() }}"
            },
            {
              "keyName": "fcm_token",
              "condition": "isNotEmpty"
            }
          ]
        },
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6116efcc-e872-49bc-8e34-fce2dd3a01f6",
      "name": "¿Hay dispositivos?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.fcm_token }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d22267c0-1ecd-471f-a31e-5f415f88cac4",
      "name": "Enviar FCM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        720,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/v1/projects/REPLACE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID/messages:send",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ message: { token: $json.fcm_token, android: { priority: \"HIGH\", ttl: \"3600s\" }, data: { nc: \"1\", id: String($execution.id) + \"-\" + $json.id, to: String($json.email || \"\").toLowerCase(), title: String($(\"Al llamar desde otro workflow\").first().json.title || \"n8n Connect\"), body: String($(\"Al llamar desde otro workflow\").first().json.body || \"\"), actions: JSON.stringify($(\"Al llamar desde otro workflow\").first().json.actions || []), app: String($(\"Al llamar desde otro workflow\").first().json.app || \"\") } } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          },
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID:n8n Connect FCM",
          "name": "n8n Connect FCM"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4338433-d215-4335-817a-3a1ca9f53c17",
      "name": "Resumen de envío",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Cuenta envíos y detecta tokens caducados (FCM responde 404 UNREGISTERED)\nconst results = $input.all();\nconst devices = $(\"Dispositivos con push\").all();\nconst unregistered = [];\nlet sent = 0;\nresults.forEach((item, i) => {\n  const res = item.json;\n  if (res.statusCode === 200) sent += 1;\n  else if (res.statusCode === 404 || JSON.stringify(res.body ?? \"\").includes(\"UNREGISTERED\")) unregistered.push(devices[i]?.json.device_id);\n});\nreturn [{ json: { sent, failed: results.length - sent, unregistered: unregistered.filter(Boolean) } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8901bec4-6a6e-4feb-8bd3-7250374f3dee",
      "name": "Sin dispositivos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sent",
              "name": "sent",
              "value": 0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "failed",
              "name": "failed",
              "value": 0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "reason",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "no_devices",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "id": "4d7f506d-7d3b-4cf8-b5ac-23b9868bcb0c",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2f594f7e",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        -192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enviar acciones al móvil (FCM)\nLlama a este workflow con **Execute Sub-workflow**: email, title, body, actions (array de acciones n8n Connect, p. ej. `[{\"type\":\"set_alarm\",\"hour\":7,\"minute\":30}]`) y app (id opcional para abrir).\n\nEnvía un mensaje **data** de alta prioridad a cada dispositivo de nc_devices con token y devuelve `{sent, failed}`. Requiere una credencial **Google Service Account** del proyecto Firebase con el scope `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/firebase.messaging`.",
        "height": 448,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
